<h1 style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;">Verify Your Email</h1>
<p style="margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.6;">
  Please verify your email address by clicking the button below:
</p>
<div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px;">
  <a href="{{verifyUrl}}" class="btn">Verify Email</a>
</div>
<p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
  Or copy this link: <a href="{{verifyUrl}}">{{verifyUrl}}</a>
</p>
<div class="divider"></div>
<p style="font-size: 14px; color: #999; line-height: 1.6;">
  If you didn't create an account, you can safely ignore this email.
</p>
